# Allowlist: ignore everything, then permit only the code.
# The working tree holds ~600 MB of datasets and research documents that must
# never be committed, so an opt-in list is safer than chasing exclusions.
/*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!requirements.txt
!vital_jacket.py

# Datasets are downloaded by the script, never vendored:
#   Heart Sound/circor/   449 MB, PhysioNet, ODC-By
#   Heart Sound/dataset/  PASCAL challenge wavs
# Generated output lives in reports/ and is reproducible from a single run.
